{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "8d18f79da33c356a433357d86ef63d6f12d0393bf7a401aa168fbc536b2b3d56", "ja": "ただいま！", "zh": "我回来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7395c19fe22559dde83e926a8ec03853d0f09db50b87a1552d86b515051dafe2", "ja": "地方公演は大成功。劇場に戻ってきた伊織と\nエミリーは、久しぶりの安心感からか、いつ\nも以上にリラックスしている。仙台のおみや\nげをお茶請けに、アイドル達の賑やかな声は\nいつまでも響いていた。", "zh": "地方公演大获成功。回到剧场的伊织和\n艾米莉，或许是因为久违的安心感，比平\n时更加放松。就着仙台的特产茶点，偶像\n们热闹欢快的声音久久回荡着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fc7f02ad25c9113d716589a4f43f2929ee975b5e38c9c4ab7879c125be861671", "ja": "（仙台公演は、大成功のうちに終わった！\n今日は次の仕事のミーティングだけど……）", "zh": "（仙台公演在大获成功中落下了帷幕！今天要开下一个工作的会议，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "bb7186e4057e9e1472e9cfb2d896fffee9103c419663f3903b11fc3e2e529669", "ja": "はぁ～……。\n劇場は、やっぱり落ち着きましゅ……♪", "zh": "哈啊～……\n剧场果然还是让人安心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "3863e737f936d59d88d73339e9d06117c6829cc1a77fab9f2e757cd33055d2ad", "ja": "その通りねぇ……ふぅ～。", "zh": "的确呢……呼～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f23f2efb41a1c1e7de061edbc5faae759948c0ab23ef2d4735cf6e72036d5738", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れ様。\n……そろそろ、ミーティングの時間なんだけど……。", "zh": "你们两个都辛苦了。\n……差不多该开会了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "f5a9f342403544b65ff62af5599908dc0fe57adfc7ab15483fe8d7cbe0f1bcfb", "ja": "あら、そうだったかしら？\nでも……ね、エミリー？", "zh": "哎呀，是这样吗？\n不过……对吧，艾米莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "50d7260079e7f18d86294096956da141307b7a0aef377f80fcbab48f3c583853", "ja": "そうですね～、伊織さま……はいー……。", "zh": "是啊～，伊织大人……嗯——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d33010bd81240cc396540c93a5252cbba4d5d7721d55164a3a83d6e82b4abef6", "ja": "どうしたんだ、ふたりとも？\nなんだか、だるーんとしてないか？", "zh": "你们两个这是怎么了？\n怎么感觉都无精打采的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "80bda425472e62d993c3888408421d56f41cfa53afe6f3c46aba20d43e8fd941", "ja": "だるーん、なんて……失礼ね。\nただ……久しぶりの劇場だから、かしら……。", "zh": "“无精打采”什么的……真失礼。\n只是……因为好久没来剧场了，或许是这样吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "1590306168621d0a2bcc5d68716af88210d917d0e5e627fd0ea7339d63ef84f8", "ja": "はい。お家のような安心感で……\nまったりとしてしまって……。", "zh": "是的。因为有种像回到家一样的安心感……不知不觉就放松下来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "43607ccdf0a0015c5e43aad31786a3cfcef876fd4fa07245a4ee7360f51cb71d", "ja": "仕方ないな。\nお茶でも飲んで、目を覚ましてくれないか？", "zh": "真拿你没办法。喝点茶，清醒一下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "c200b2156b38a7ea74d38d6c57f7e16bd7bcdfe701611f37128b6686a5d2f2d1", "ja": "お茶……はっ、そうでした！　伊織さま、\n仕掛け人さま、仙台で買ったお土産を食べませんか？", "zh": "茶……啊，对了！伊织大人，制作人，要不要吃吃看我在仙台买的伴手礼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "eaac36236796545b56c46fa114413dc235ad5073f90b8f723cedf1950b8f9e38", "ja": "そういえば、お土産をたくさん買ったのよね。\nいいわね、さっそく開けちゃいましょ♪", "zh": "说起来，我们买了好多特产呢。\n好呀，马上打开来看看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "2de08077b2a3ca4fef58643db8df0ebb4a51d6a2d9397f87d7bfcee317cb0b12", "ja": "Wow！　すごいです！\nずんだ味だけでも、こんなに種類があるのですね？", "zh": "Wow！好厉害！\n光是毛豆泥口味，就有这么多种类吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "fb73c7305a68745d6c3c3458326811432ec7fc9b4136895fcd6fccccd8a4f52e", "ja": "ふーん、どれもおいしそうじゃない。そういえば\nアンタも、なんだかいろいろ買い込んでたわよね？", "zh": "嗯，哪个看起来都挺好吃的嘛。说起来，你好像也买了不少各种各样的东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "da10fb550d7e7ff88599be4a0960e27d34af263b72f3ce8ac348f6f8b0b2ddf6", "ja": "ああ。劇場のみんなと、事務所に持っていく分が\nあるからな。ついでだから出しておくか。", "zh": "嗯。因为有要带给剧场大家和事务所的份。既然顺便，就先拿出来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "638db3f9a9a90e553198833d0289e0ea3ff8041973504be5b530fb88ab2f94d3", "ja": "あ、伊織、そのカマボコは食べちゃダメだぞ。\n社長と音無さんに持っていく分だからな。", "zh": "啊，伊织，那块鱼糕可不能吃啊。\n那是要带给社长和音无小姐的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "252e58c9b097e754788480e9a8d3e3bf7827c7314404d0b95fd663d679f2a047", "ja": "た、食べないわよ、失礼ね！？", "zh": "我、我才不会吃呢，真没礼貌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "4ad5ca2fae45896ec88c3068adbf1af3ba4ae10e96b872ebe266dfbe6e8c96c4", "ja": "お疲れさまです……わあ！\n仙台のお菓子がたくさんですね？", "zh": "辛苦了……哇！\n这是仙台的点心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "3b25c4b34eec88a1d4af3ff7b3d4c4d74f242a52ac52880d05d2b92e5d2ca8ac", "ja": "{$P$}さん、これ、お土産ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，这是特产吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d2b26e400996bd1e3ce902c81c8093df5cb8c9f54d6691f75534a0a239432606", "ja": "おお、春香。雪歩と星梨花も来たか。\nみんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "哦，春香。雪步和星梨花也来啦。\n大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6f4c3ffcf0c29bf833535a1bef13bea52e6cc47acedf9e506f23d7339cacb47c", "ja": "もしかして、みんなで食べるんですか？\nじゃあ私、お茶を淹れてきますね！", "zh": "难道要大家一起吃吗？\n那我去泡茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "c6e98b59726060ab6f5dd75e4d5b6c494ebc34e7e7ef0ce06ff70f3bb6681a8f", "ja": "あっ、私も手伝うよ！", "zh": "啊，我也来帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "aa8dd617d91ee1433852724a5e2166a990145b628fe5718e8a80ca39510a454a", "ja": "お待たせしました～！\nお茶、淹れてきましたぁ。", "zh": "让你久等了～！\n茶泡好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "98c65abadd743f287596364d5c5952aba71df4af6842662aa7c0807eeb765ca6", "ja": "雪歩、春香、ありがとう。\nさ、みんなで食べましょ！", "zh": "雪步、春香，谢谢你们。来，大家一起吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "88b032e61427be71fc490155e98b18959c4830b5b3bb4b3d37111746f5f7194f", "ja": "それでは、いただきます♪\n私は、この緑の猪口令糖を……。", "zh": "那么，我开动啦♪  \n我就吃这个绿色的巧克力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "c797126718e63fa138a02bbe7d7a525c7d5ff5b27278104da74079d1527ae7dd", "ja": "アンタも突っ立ってないで、こっち来れば？\nすこしくらいなら分けてあげるわよ。", "zh": "你也别傻站着，过来这边吧？\n分你一点还是没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "1acf8872be812da184ad06b69941d9a76ce26d162634a50f6e0d45d8576d89ec", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう……なんだか打ち合わせが、\nお菓子パーティーみたいになっちゃったな。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……不知不觉，商量事情变得像点心派对一样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "472f0912acf8a6551f78929f43855847290d9245d274df3a4a43d4d92e3cbd47", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、こっちのクッキーもおいしいですよ！\nはい、どうぞ♪", "zh": "艾米莉，这边的饼干也很好吃哦！\n来，给你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "c1d2bde8bb1bb4a5e396a0ce3c9d7b002550f048e0fb032d41e163c02edbb4e1", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　……んんっ！\nおいしいでしゅ～♪", "zh": "非常感谢♪……嗯～！\n太好契了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "0d97cb979b0697018238531c96e7186fae238bb182563e7b13106817ff472842", "ja": "ずんだ味……\nずんだ味のお菓子って、家でも作れるのかな？", "zh": "毛豆口味……\n毛豆口味的点心，在家里也能做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "855f262708523b3cfa87c76a4e5b71a35867033f8ba29f05f1e1a8eeb6bcf7c7", "ja": "ずんだは枝豆やそら豆を潰したものだそうです。お餅が\n有名ですが、芋のように潰して揚げたりもするとか。", "zh": "听说毛豆泥是把毛豆或蚕豆捣碎做成的。虽然毛豆泥糯米糕很有名，但好像也能像土豆一样捣碎后炸着吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1031_004yuk", "source_sha256": "19de0447d66cc6c594f4c3f71a83afc4d8f9872d28db9b123d72a3d99448f043", "ja": "芋のように……あ、コロッケのことかな？\nわあ、おいしそうかも……♪", "zh": "像土豆一样……啊，是说可乐饼吗？哇，感觉会很好吃呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "40ce9a7fdc6a905c1d4ac8e0db5b99d04d6a4efb9a89a94beaed56a351cba604", "ja": "春香さん、もしずんだ料理を作るなら、\n私もご一緒したいです！", "zh": "春香，如果要做毛豆料理的话，\n我也想一起参加！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "efdb1e68a44ee243b1b215d20fd67adb13a1891f1f282c234e0506959019eeec", "ja": "うん、もちろん！\nじゃあ今度、劇場のキッチンを借りて作ってみようか？", "zh": "好呀，当然可以！\n那下次借用剧场的厨房做做看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "d399e1eae6697fec26cdd67e3693a9b3b7982520ba98d5f376f1750244c84542", "ja": "なによふたりとも、楽しそうに……。\n今回エミリーとペアを組んだのは、私なのよ？", "zh": "真是的，你们两个，看起来玩得很开心嘛……\n这次和艾米莉组队的人，可是我哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_07_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ec0be64cc57b087b8df5ece6abe9b9dbea0dd17191d8658fb698ee4b23243050", "ja": "伊織……もしかしてヤキモチか？", "zh": "伊织……你该不会是在吃醋吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
